    <briefdescription>
<para>Tensor summary for results from a specific shard. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Represents compression of candidates retrieved from a single shard, with metadata about shard relevance and contribution. Includes freshness tracking for distributed summary-first routing. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
